  "description": "ASP.NET Core host for a Rask WebAssembly app written in C#. `app.MapRaskSpa()` serves the published bundle with correct MIME types, cache headers that follow what the publish guarantees, precompressed siblings and a SPA fallback that still 404s a missing asset; a referenced WebAssembly client is published by the build and served from its build output, with hot reload, under `rask dev`. Rask.Server's wasm-hosted apps use it through RaskApp; it depends on nothing else in Rask.",
